 ed in part by The ’Quin House’s Art Curator\, Kate Chertavian. Bringin
 g her expertise and passion for the arts to the table\, Kate will help gui
 de conversations that may explore everything from The ’Quin’s own art 
 collection to the broader world of art and culture\, inviting fresh perspe
 ctives and meaningful exchanges along the way.\n\nOver a beautifully curat
 ed three-course dinner with expertly paired wines\, members will have the 
 opportunity to share stories\, exchange ideas\, and get to know one anothe
 r beyond the everyday. Settle in for an evening where engaging dialogue\, 
 great food\, and good company come together.\n\n*Tickets are $100 per pers
 on\, plus tax\, and are reserved for members only. Cancellations within 72
