DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 120 spots left\n
 Status: futureSale\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/211
 490\n\nJoin us in The Reading Room for a ’Quin Chat exploring the artist
 s\, influences\, and connections behind our fall exhibition. Phil Alexandr
 e\, President & Director of Alexandre Gallery\, joins artists Tessa Greene
  O’Brien and Meghan Brady for a conversation moderated by The ’Quin’
 s art collection curator\, Kate Chertavian\, offering fresh perspectives o
 n the works on view throughout the ’House.\n\nSpanning the Lobby\, Grand
  Staircase\, and Reading Room\, the exhibition features 25 works on loan t
 hrough Alexandre Gallery\, including paintings by Lois Dodd\, Loren MacIve
 r\, Pat Adams\, Tessa Greene O’Brien\, Lisa Sanditz\, Meghan Brady and E
 mily Nelligan. Together\, we will explore how these artists translate the 
 world around them through distinct approaches to color\, form\, landscape\
 , and abstraction - and consider the shared influences and individual visi
 ons that connect their work across generations.\n\n*This event is complime
 ntary and reserved for members\, plus one guest. Complimentary light bit
 es and refreshments will be served. Cancellations made within 24 hours of 
 the event\, or failure to attend\, will result in a $25 charge.
